                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Although I liked the other two similar games from this publisher, where you have to collect animals and Japanese women, and I even recommended them, I will give this game a negative review. Eye-straining flickering videos are disgusting. Don't show off, you need to take care of your customers and you shouldn't ruin their eyesight. Just remember that time-lapse photography is NOT SUITABLE for creating puzzles from it!\nPass by, take care of your eyes, better buy their other two games, but not this one.",
